{"job_id":"F-f3f02f52aa22a5736102","family_id":"F-f3f02f52aa22a5736102","title":"육군부사관학교령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"de297c666deb3294822a5ad89daba9a4e6833174027b0605b624de192ddfb864","source_hash":"f5de7177157e72bd134277f0c474a0a196423129e1d15703fc47008909a92161","text":"陆军士官学校规章"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":97,"target_id":"48dfe05c337b1c4d5207e9a1885b37a57a08c2928ae4c1314748aa529b367c15","source_hash":"105b18410023bf8031eaaf1b5069360aaf823671f3827e2bcdc15761aa5b3ab7","text":"第一条（设施和任务）\n①在陆军中建立陆军士官学校。\n陆军士官学校负责培训陆军士官，进行复训，并研究和发展小部队战术及其必要的理论。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":97,"end":226,"target_id":"ea3774eb31e00f639e46faa12c464043b04f9c15d168614c299e81811b73a18b","source_hash":"4342b357e6440f9493ac25d591a1c4717869e4b10bf1de1f17db5124edd90090","text":"第二条（校长等）\n① 陆军士官学校（以下简称“士官学校”）应任命一名校长。\n② 学校校长应由陆军将领担任。<2017年9月5日修订>\n校长奉陆军参谋长的命令，负责学校事务，并指挥和监督附属单位。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":226,"end":363,"target_id":"e230722b1b9202660f20ac6d2ef378ef93b8fed0fa252c67314142b0c7b58c17","source_hash":"21975599d3910b9afbe2f2fe2b1c198c543cb1b42d5206b40d0b0bff71cabdf5","text":"第三条（附属单位和参谋部门的设立）\n①建立士官学校所需的附属单位和参谋部门。\n② 根据第1款规定设立附属单位的事务、任务和组织，由国防部长决定；设立参谋部门及其职责划分，由陆军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":363,"end":427,"target_id":"2dea46da4de1c1f58c437e713c69dc66abd7146edbaced3e3bbf0de7c290e755","source_hash":"857f1c4e50cea37a7bd28cabe8315a7cca31c6a7a97b308b91868201ce333f66","text":"第四条（课程等）士官学校的课程设置和上课时间，以及与学校运作有关的其他事项，由陆军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":427,"end":472,"target_id":"2745e4b6028cee94907b384e455eef941728f5d5f640c7330b3fa16a060baff6","source_hash":"ccd65364f323ac0766e1e985df324c00b04132af6d6b91ff303dd0d706b04b87","text":"第五条（人员配额）士官学校驻扎的军事人员和文职人员的人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":472,"end":522,"target_id":"e4ff2d02eea7e06d7533eb6a894812591b4dab54aa25c6e92ec2ce07e9651a29","source_hash":"71b074d0dc7d6f565c5963a22835f834be0217e38b834fc776aaa455992d5225","text":"补充规定 <第19361号，2006年2月28日>\n\n本法令自2006年3月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":522,"end":555,"target_id":"872071932ac8f020890cb5204cd22054e23daaffff49b3e722a581a759bb3236","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":555,"end":592,"target_id":"c265db31d177d14ce7dbef26520d1cc790e4b70d52160aae0ea66f82253935e1","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":592,"end":606,"target_id":"41068a97e54384eb8d4b7ebbd3562423ab63b1445e05b3d14add93c34b76d88b","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010173-197282-ko","scope":"BODY","start":606,"end":724,"target_id":"3122ebb1c9de6a7682db6e35bb4347de7559ef26da67804505c5b57212565cf3","source_hash":"5c262c4afe43d60f54b75391b37e9d7d5045541708fac8be6b82efe7784847e3","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<62>款已省略\n\n  <63> 陆军士官学校规章部分修订如下。\n\n  第 2 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <64> 至 <90> 已省略"}]}